<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic mb-6">About Nina</h2>
<div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
<p>With over 10 years in 3C mobile accessories procurement, Nina Nico leads <a href="/about/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline">WOWOHCOOL</a>'s global sourcing and manufacturing partnerships from Shenzhen, China. She helps brands, retailers, and distributors worldwide build agile, trustworthy supply chains — because their success depends on quality, speed, and transparency.</p>
<p>Nina's approach combines deep factory-floor knowledge with cross-border negotiation expertise. She works directly with WOWOHCOOL's 50+ in-house R&D engineers and vetted factory network to deliver custom-designed chargers, power banks, wireless chargers, and cables that match each brand's vision — with competitive global pricing and zero-compromise QC.</p>
<p>Fluent in English, German, Spanish, and Chinese, Nina bridges the communication gap between European and Latin American procurement managers and Shenzhen engineering teams — a critical advantage in an industry where specification misunderstandings can cost tens of thousands in rework and delayed shipments.</p>
</div>
